        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Average processes for producing chromium steel products.\n\n# Included processes\nThis data set includes the materials and resources needed for producing one chromium steel sink. The sink contains two basins of different size and a drainboard. The sink has the dimensions 965 x 510 x 600 mm and a weight of 8.7 kg. The data base on information from Franke GmbH. Chromium steel with a recycling content of 80 % is used. The valves are made of PET, PP and HDPE. Transport to the construction site and mounting are not included.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
